 ——————————– Presented by Mickey’s Black Box & Musi
 c For Everyone ————————————————– Jazz an
 d blues vocalist Ava Preston is a rising star\, gaining attention nationwi
 de as an exceptional singer\, composer and arranger. Ava will be accompani
 ed by pianist Cameron Campbell\, bassist Allison Lee and drummer Janae Yat
 es. Just 21 years old\, Ava this year won the 2026 Ella Fitzgerald Interna
 tional Jazz Vocal Competition and earned her master’s degree in jazz voi
 ce from Juilliard. During her middle school\, high school and college year
 s\, Ava was a 12-time winner of the Student Music Award bestowed by DownBe
 at magazine — capturing the top Vocal Jazz Soloist honor six times and t
 he top Blues/Pop/Rock Soloist honor six times. Ava is passionate about bri
 nging live jazz to the public\, creating in 2025 an ongoing initiative cal
 led “Sidewalk Swing: Bringing Jazz & Joy to Every Corner” that places 
 combos of student musicians on the streets of Manhattan. “I believe that
  music is a universal language that can unite people around the world\,”
  Ava says. “My hope is to move society in a positive direction with my a
 rt … My goal is to spread world tolerance and the acceptance of differen
 ces through my music.” Check out Ava Preston here! Website | Instagram |
  Facebook THANK YOU TO OUR SUPPORTERS! Robert M. Lauman Charitable Foundat
 ion John Swanson Gaylord and Nadine Poling Farmstead Friends of Jazz Rich 
 & Elena Wolman Art Lumsden The Fresh Takes series would not be possible wi
 thout the generous support of our community. —————————
